  <path d="M12 8h.01" />
</svg><span class="sr-only">This chart&#39;s appVersion is prometheus-operator&#39;s. Prometheus, Alertmanager and the other bundled images can change without it.</span></span>
          </td>
          <td><a href="https://github.com/prometheus-operator/prometheus-operator" class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">prometheus-operator/prometheus-operator</a></td>
